WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.270 align:start position:0%
 
i  tire of the empty battles i once created  i wonder outcast  while my tribe curses the gods who  abandoned us  our home is in ruins  yet i stand firm  six days ago the falling star  struck the town of tristram  the dead rose in its wake  what evil is this  could it be what i have sought these  long years  a foe worthy of my blade  this place reeks of death the fallen  star is near  so  i seek the fallen star it fell on the  old cathedral  there was only one survivor captain  rumford are coming  we can't open the gates  they keep coming  the ancients drunk never seen anyone  fight like that before  gods open the gates you'll find lea at  the slaughtered calf inn  burn those corpses before they rise  [Music]  again  rumford said you survived the fallen  star i did  but it blasted my uncle deckard kane  into the depths of the old cathedral  i tried to search for him but the dead  were already rising i came back here to  rally the militias  [Music]  this is killing business  the dead will overwhelm us all unless  somebody i will send them back to their  grave thank you  you should speak with  you

